{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:0.4"], "en": "7. The Mahāsupina Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:1.1"], "en": "“The bull, the trees, the cows, and the ox;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:1.2"], "en": "the horse, the bronze vessel, the female jackal, and the jar.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:1.3"], "en": "\"A lotus pond and yellow sandalwood,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:1.4"], "en": "gourds sink and stones float.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:2.1"], "en": "The female frogs swallow black snakes.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:2.2"], "en": "Suparṇas surround the crow;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:2.3"], "en": "the timid wolves fear the sheep.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:2.4"], "en": "This reversal of roles prevails; it does not exist here [in the ultimate sense].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_77:3.1"], "en": "The Mahāsupina Jātaka, the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
